6. SEQUENTIAL VS PARALLEL LATENCY
============================================================

SEQUENTIAL:

Tool A → Tool B → Tool C → Tool D

2s       2s       2s       2s

Total ≈ 8 seconds


PARALLEL:

Tool A ────── 2s
Tool B ────── 2s
Tool C ────── 2s
Tool D ────── 2s

All execute simultaneously.

Total ≈ 2 seconds


