14. QUALITY SCORE ROUTING
============================================================

With 4 equally weighted sources:

4 / 4 = 1.00 → Opportunity Analysis

3 / 4 = 0.75 → Risk Analysis

2 / 4 = 0.50 → Risk Analysis

1 / 4 = 0.25 → Fallback Report

0 / 4 = 0.00 → Fallback Report


Routing Rules:

quality_score >= 0.80
→ Opportunity Analysis

quality_score >= 0.50 AND quality_score < 0.80
→ Risk Analysis

quality_score < 0.50
→ Fallback Report


